"A pre-affixation trade is a trade made with another empowered person."
"It needs a witness, and Gorgon at the Chicago consulate may serve as one."
"It is the only time class trades are allowed: in the grace period, between equal ranks."
"Both parties must be willing selectees from the same planet, still in their grace periods."
"A reasonable share of new Avowed trade, skewed heavily toward lower ranks."
"A selectee may trade as many times as desired before the ninety days end."
"Artonans do not care about trades between equal ranks."
"The witness guards against threats and mind sway, since some island parents use both."
"Bribery and social pressure are allowed; the witness steps in only on threats or mind control."
"A selectee stays vouched for only while in the room; the witness reactivates the table."
